---
description: The ESLint config generator: plugin registry, generated rule catalog, presets and config output
globs:
  - "src/features/generator/**"
  - "scripts/generate-rule-catalog.mjs"
  - "scripts/check-updates.mjs"
alwaysApply: false
---

For changes to the generator, read and follow `docs/generator.md` and the
"Generator rules" section of `AGENTS.md`. Never edit the generated files in
`src/features/generator/catalog/` by hand; run `pnpm catalog` instead.
